   "html": "<header class=\"bar\"><a href=\"/\">Alex Carter</a><nav><a href=\"/\">Work</a><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"mailto:hello@alexcarter.studio\">Contact</a></nav></header>\n<main><span class=\"k\">Services</span><h1>What I can do for you</h1>\n<p class=\"lede\">Design, web, photo, video and motion from one independent creative. Replace these lists with your own services.</p>\n<h2>Design & Branding</h2><p>Logo and identity, Typography and color systems, Guidelines and templates.</p><h2>Web & Digital</h2><p>Websites and landing pages, Social and digital assets, Presentation design.</p><h2>Photo & Video</h2><p>Portraits and products, Short-form video, Editing and retouching.</p><h2>Motion & Animation</h2><p>Animated logos, Reels and loops, Title sequences.</p><h2>Creative Direction</h2><p>Campaign concepts, Art direction and imagery, Content planning.</p></main>"
